<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's J.Martins Q1 net profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's J.Martins Q1 net profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to March 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net attributable profit	  1.31 vs 1.06</p>
<p>Net earnings per share	 48 esc vs 40</p>
<p>Cons net			     2.28 vs 1.80</p>
<p>Operating result		   3.72 vs 3.20</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Estabelecimentos Jeronimo Martins &amp; Filhos SGPS.  </p>
<p>Net sales			  93.498 vs 78.010</p>
<p>Minority interests		  963 vs 742</p>
<p>Current results		   2,853 vs 2,142</p>
<p>Amortization of goodwill	  814 vs 762</p>
<p>NOTE: The number of shares in March 1996 was adjusted in order to be comparable with March 1997.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
